四 、一起诵读： 感恩祈愿文
Part Four: Group Recitation of the Gratitude and Prayer Text

感恩自然的馈赠， 感恩父母的哺育，
we should be grateful for the gifts of nature and the nurturing of our parents.

感恩师长的教诲， 感恩国土的滋养，
I am grateful for the teachings of my mentors and the nurturing of my homeland.

感恩众生的成就， 感恩三宝的护佑。
be grateful for the accomplishments of all sentient beings, and be thankful for the protection of the Three Treasures.

愿我们对拥有的一切心怀感恩， 也愿我们因感恩而乐于付出，
May we be grateful for all we have, and may this gratitude inspire us to give generously,

更愿这份感恩给众生带去慰藉， 唤醒那些尘封的心灵， 消融所有自他的隔阂，
we hope that this gratitude can bring comfort to all sentient beings, awaken those souls that have been languishing in the dust of time, and dissolve all barriers between self and others,

愿人们在感恩中敞开心扉， 彼此关爱，
May people open their hearts and care for each other with gratitude,

愿世界在感恩中充满温暖， 处处和平。
May the world be filled with warmth and peace through gratitude.

五 、 回向
V. Dedication

